WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]
Hi guys.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:03.270
Soon it will be a new year.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.980
And when the clock
strikes 12:00,

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.020
I want you to
become the new you.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:07.900
What's she like?

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.700
I don't know.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.571
I haven't seen her for
a really long time.

00:00:11.571 --> 00:00:13.439
[INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:15.570
(ECHOING) Hey guys.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.516
I'm Danielle Williams, founder
of Very, Very Vegetable.

00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:19.914
Make sure to tune in.

00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:21.778
[INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.120
Hey.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.800
I'm so grateful you
invited me tonight.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:26.600
[POPPING]

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.010
[GASPING]

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.830
[MUSIC BOX PLAYING]

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.660
Never have I ever bullied a
perfectly sweet, innocent girl

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.430
until she committed suicide.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.801
[LIGHTNING CRACKS]

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:40.629
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:42.900
The world deserves
to know the truth.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.000
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.700
Come out Lex.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:48.600
[SCREAMING]

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.300
[MUSIC STOPS]

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.500
[SCREAMING]

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.950
[MUSIC BOX PLAYING]

